# `/replaceitem entity` 的**各实体容器大小**。
#
# 1.12.2 的槽位号是**容器内的索引**，超出容器大小就放不进去，报
# "Could not replace slot <slot> with <n> * [<item>]"。
#
# 而**槽位名本身不存在**时报的是另一句："'<名字>' is not a valid parameter"。
# 这两件事要分开：前者是槽位放不进去，后者是名字没注册。
#
# 这一轮问的是每个实体的容器有多大。
#
# bot: Steve

--- console ---
say Y01
summon armor_stand 0 4 0 {CustomName:"AS"}
say Y02
summon zombie 8 4 0 {CustomName:"ZB"}
say Y03
summon pig 12 4 0 {CustomName:"PG"}
say Y04
summon villager 16 4 0 {CustomName:"VL"}
say Y05
summon horse 20 4 0 {CustomName:"HS"}
say Y06
summon enderman 24 4 0 {CustomName:"EM"}
say Y07
replaceitem entity @e[type=armor_stand] slot.weapon.mainhand stone
say Y08
replaceitem entity @e[type=armor_stand] slot.weapon.offhand stone
say Y09
replaceitem entity @e[type=armor_stand] slot.armor.head stone
say Y10
replaceitem entity @e[type=armor_stand] slot.armor.chest stone
say Y11
replaceitem entity @e[type=zombie] slot.weapon.mainhand stone
say Y12
replaceitem entity @e[type=zombie] slot.weapon.offhand stone
say Y13
replaceitem entity @e[type=zombie] slot.armor.head stone
say Y14
replaceitem entity @e[type=zombie] slot.armor.chest stone
say Y15
replaceitem entity @e[type=pig] slot.weapon.mainhand stone
say Y16
replaceitem entity @e[type=pig] slot.armor.head stone
say Y17
replaceitem entity @e[type=villager] slot.weapon.mainhand stone
say Y18
replaceitem entity @e[type=villager] slot.armor.head stone
say Y19
replaceitem entity @e[type=horse] slot.horse.saddle stone
say Y20
replaceitem entity @e[type=horse] slot.horse.0 stone
say Y21
replaceitem entity @e[type=enderman] slot.weapon.mainhand stone
say Y22
replaceitem entity @e[type=enderman] slot.armor.head stone
say Y23
replaceitem entity Steve slot.weapon.mainhand stone
say Y24
replaceitem entity Steve slot.weapon.offhand stone
say Y25
replaceitem entity Steve slot.armor.head stone
say Y26
replaceitem entity Steve slot.armor.chest stone
say Y27
replaceitem entity Steve slot.armor.legs stone
say Y28
replaceitem entity Steve slot.armor.feet stone
say Y29
replaceitem entity Steve slot.inventory.35 stone
say Y30
replaceitem entity Steve slot.enderchest.26 stone
say Y31
